WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:02.301
Draw a square on each side.

2
00:00:02.928 --> 00:00:06.203
Sides three and three: nine and nine make eighteen.

3
00:00:06.831 --> 00:00:10.906
Make one side four. Nine and sixteen make twenty-five.

4
00:00:14.457 --> 00:00:17.582
So the long side is the square root: five.
